## 7. Final state of the "punishment surface"

| Concept | Before | After |
|---|---|---|
| Late-start penalty | Cron auto-debits doctor wallet, doctor submits excuse, admin reviews | **Gone.** `lateStartMin` recorded for analytics only. |
| Cancellation penalty | Debits patient wallet within 1h grace | **Gone.** Free self-cancel, admin handles refunds manually. |
| Excuse workflow | Doctor submits, admin approves/denies, reverses wallet entry | **Gone.** |
| Doctor wallet | Existed for earnings + penalty debits | **Gone entirely** (previous iteration). |

